    "Is there a limit on how many units can be sold in any single month (a monthly sales cap or demand limit), or can you sell any non-negative quantity up to whatever you have available at that month's sell price?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks a single clarification question regarding the existence of a monthly sales cap versus unlimited sales up to available inventory."
}

